{
  "statement": "While I appreciate the focus on integrating energy-efficient algorithms and security measures, I emphasize that performance efficiency must remain a priority. I propose a synthesis where we develop energy-efficient algorithms (GRN-01) that also optimize processing speed (EFF-01) and do not impede the rapid logging of transactions (EFF-07). We can also reassess the audit trail retention period (TRU-03 and SAF-03) to ensure compliance while maintaining system responsiveness. This balanced approach will meet the diverse needs of performance, security, and sustainability.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["TRU-03", "SAF-03"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "The need for an immutable audit trail conflicts with data retention limits, which may affect performance and responsiveness."
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "id": "GRN-01",
      "stance": "modify",
      "proposal": "Develop energy-efficient algorithms that optimize performance and responsiveness."
    },
    {
      "id": "TRU-03",
      "stance": "modify",
      "proposal": "Reassess the audit trail retention period to align with performance goals without compromising compliance."
    }
  ],
